From c656a95db9742812b248540fa959aa68c5dac978 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: wuzichun <wuzichun@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 08:48:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] [experiment] gather: per-pull slot ring on consumer side
 (fix KV corruption under concurrent pulls)

Consumer allocates VLLM_MOONCAKE_GATHER_SLOTS (default 4) pinned slots and
advertises one free slot per pull; slot returned after scatter (finally).
Empty pool -> advertise addr=0 and the producer falls back to per-descriptor
transfer. Verified: 2P1D x 16 concurrent distinct prompts, zero garbage
outputs (was 2/16 garbage + 15/16 diverged before the fix).

Co-authored-by: Kimi Code <noreply@moonshot.cn>
---
 .../v1/mooncake/mooncake_connector.py         | 96 +++++++++++++------
 vllm/envs.py                                  | 12 ++-
 vllm/v1/core/sched/scheduler.py               |  1 +
 3 files changed, 76 insertions(+), 33 deletions(-)

diff --git a/vllm/distributed/kv_transfer/kv_connector/v1/mooncake/mooncake_connector.py b/vllm/distributed/kv_transfer/kv_connector/v1/mooncake/mooncake_connector.py
